data: {"id": "7d7df52270fe4b18-thinking-parallel_evidence-137", "run_id": "7d7df52270fe4b18", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮可观测性已采集完成。日志已明确显示 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing`，这指向配置缺失导致的启动失败。现在我需要通过 `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl get yaml` 来确认 Pod 状态、Exit Code、以及该环境变量是否确实未在容器定义中设置，以完成最终定性。\n\n补证计划：\n1. `kubectl describe pod` 确认 Last State 的 Exit Code 和 Reason\n2. `kubectl get pod -o yaml` 确认容器环境变量和 command 定义\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789141745558, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

